cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite it as below."
title: "Post-Quantum TLS on Embedded Devices: measurement artifact"
abstract: "Code, build configurations, patches, raw measurements, packet captures and figure scripts behind the ESE Kongress 2026 paper 'Post-Quantum TLS on Embedded Devices: What It Costs', which measures ML-KEM, ML-DSA, Falcon, SLH-DSA, LMS and XMSS in wolfSSL's TLS 1.3 on an NXP FRDM-RW612, an ST NUCLEO-H743ZI, a Raspberry Pi 3B+ and a Raspberry Pi 5."
authors:
  - family-names: "Frauenschläger"
    given-names: "Tobias"
    affiliation: "wolfSSL Inc."
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Frauschi/ese2026-pq-tls-embedded"
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - TLS 1.3
  - embedded systems
  - Zephyr
  - wolfSSL
  - ML-KEM
  - ML-DSA
  - SLH-DSA
  - LMS
  - XMSS
